  "RQ4 metrics": "Accuracy, precision, recall, F1-score, MAE, MSE, RMSE, inference time, model size; BARTScore, exact match rates, and expert judgments",
  "RQ4 baseline_type": "ML/DL architecture comparisons; intent-recognition model and prompt-engineered LLaMA comparisons against expert-verified GPT-4 references",
  "RQ4 headline_result": "EVCS LSTM detection: 99.3% accuracy and 99.33% F1-score; LLaMA3-8B SSA EVCS responses: 0.93 accuracy-based BARTScore",
  "RQ4 compared_to": "EVCS detection: MLP and XGBoost; SSA: LLaMA2-7B and LLaMA2-13B, using expert-verified GPT-4 references",
